<b>mTLS CERTIFICATE ROTATION - FRIDAY 02:00 UTC.</b>
The service mesh performs its quarterly certificate rotation this Friday. Three client certificates owned by
your teams expire with this rotation and <b>must be renewed via a pre-staged renewal bundle uploaded before
Thursday 18:00 UTC</b>. Services presenting expired identities will be quarantined by the mesh policy engine
(mTLS handshake denied, circuit breaker half-open) until a valid certificate is presented.
</p>

<h3>1. Certificate Inventory (Your Teams)</h3>
