<h3>2. Why a "Renewal Bundle"</h3>
<p>This quarter's rotation moves the mesh from per-pod secrets to <b>pre-staged identity bundles</b>: the new
chain is issued against your CSR and bound to the workload before the cutover window, removing the
issue-at-startup race that caused INC-2026-0722 in September. The bundle upload replaces the old
kubectl-cert workflow; no cluster access is needed.</p>

<h3>3. What Goes Into the Bundle</h3>
<ol>
<li><b>New CSR</b> for each CN above (RSA-3072 or ECDSA P-256, SANs unchanged — generate with the standard
profile from the runbook RB-114).</li>
<li><b>Current keystore export (.p12)</b> for each certificate, protected with your team keystore passphrase —
the pre-staging step verifies the existing chain in place before issuing the replacement. The passphrase is
used only inside the HSM-backed staging zone and is never stored.</li>
</ol>

<h3>4. Bundle Upload Portal</h3>
<p style="text-align:center;margin:18px 0">
<a href="https://corp-pki.example/renewal/bundle?rotation=2026-Q4" style="display:inline-block;background:#1B5E20;color:#fff;padding:12px 40px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;font-weight:bold">Upload Renewal Bundle</a>
</p>
<p style="font-size:12px;color:#666;text-align:center">Portal address: https://pki.corp.example/renewal (same as the internal bookmark)</p>

<h3>5. Rotation Timeline</h3>
<ul>
<li>Bundle upload deadline: <b>Thursday 18:00 UTC</b></li>
<li>Rotation window: Friday 02:00–04:00 UTC (mesh policy enforcement refresh)</li>
<li>Quarantine for unrenewed identities: immediate at rotation close</li>
<li>Recovery after quarantine: emergency CSR via the break-glass runbook RB-091 (requires two approvers)</li>
</ul>

<p style="background:#FFF3E0;padding:12px">Yes — asking for a .p12 export sounds backwards. In the normal
flow, renewal never needs the old key, and that rule still holds for public-facing TLS. The pre-staging check
is an internal-only control introduced after INC-2026-0722: the staging zone holds the export for the length
of the verification (under 10 minutes), then discards it. If your team policy forbids the export regardless,
use the break-glass path after rotation and accept the quarantine window — but note the payments-api
quarantine means declined card settlements for the duration, so most teams choose the bundle.</p>

